(NER-SMARTLOG: AI Street Logistics & Hazard Intelligence Portal) Tj T*
/F1 8.5 Tf 11 TL
0.39 0.45 0.55 rg
(Smart India Hackathon 2026  |  Problem Statement 26002  |  Ministry of Development of NER [MDoNER]) Tj T*
0 0 0 rg
T*
/F2 11 Tf 14 TL
0.12 0.23 0.54 rg
(1. EXECUTIVE PROJECT SUMMARY) Tj T*
/F1 8 Tf 11 TL
0.15 0.20 0.30 rg
(NER-SMARTLOG is an AI-powered predictive logistics and road hazard telemetry portal engineered specifically) Tj T*
(for the 8 North Eastern states (Assam, Arunachal Pradesh, Meghalaya, Manipur, Mizoram, Nagaland, Tripura, and) Tj T*
(Sikkim). It provides automated risk assessment, live weather telemetry, mountain corridor re-routing, and) Tj T*
(synchronized field-to-headquarters disaster dispatch to prevent critical supply-chain paralysis (vaccines, oxygen,) Tj T*
(relief grain) caused by monsoonal landslides, mudflows, flash floods, and alpine road washouts.) Tj T*
T*
/F2 9.5 Tf 12 TL
0.01 0.52 0.78 rg
(Core System Specifications:) Tj T*
/F1 7.5 Tf 10.5 TL
0.20 0.25 0.35 rg
(  * Problem Statement ID  : SIH 26002 [Ministry of Development of North Eastern Region - MDoNER]) Tj T*
(  * Strategic Corridors   : NH-10 [Sikkim], NH-13 [Arunachal Sela Corridor], NH-29 [Nagaland], NH-37 & NH-6 [Assam/Meghalaya]) Tj T*
(  * Primary Personas/Roles: 1) BRO Ground Patrol Officer | 2) Convoy Logistics Commander | 3) SDMA Disaster Controller) Tj T*
(  * Core Technology Stack : Python Flask, Jinja ChoiceLoader, OSRM Graph Engine, Open-Meteo NWP API, Leaflet.js GIS) Tj T*
T*
/F2 11 Tf 14 TL
0.12 0.23 0.54 rg
(2. MATHEMATICAL HAZARD RISK MODEL & SCORING EQUATION) Tj T*
/F1 8 Tf 11 TL
0.15 0.20 0.30 rg
(The AI decision engine evaluates corridor segments using a weighted multi-factor vulnerability equation:) Tj T*
/F2 8.5 Tf 11.5 TL
0.01 0.40 0.65 rg
(  Risk Score = (0.30 x R) + (0.25 x L) + (0.20 x S) + (0.10 x T) + (0.10 x H) + (0.05 x E)) Tj T*
/F1 7.5 Tf 10 TL
0.25 0.30 0.40 rg
(  Where: R = Precipitation [mm/hr] | L = Landslide & Geological Slope Gradient | S = Ground Passability [BRO Alert]) Tj T*
(         T = Traffic Density | H = Historical Hazard Frequency | E = Altitude & Elevation Fog Index) Tj T*
(  Thresholds: 0-30: LOW [Clear] | 31-60: MEDIUM [Single-lane] | 61-80: HIGH [Caution] | 81-100: CRITICAL [Auto-Reroute]) Tj T*
T*
/F2 11 Tf 14 TL
0.12 0.23 0.54 rg
(3. TECHNICAL ARCHITECTURAL HIGHLIGHTS) Tj T*
/F1 8 Tf 10.5 TL
0.15 0.20 0.30 rg
(  * ChoiceLoader Template Resolution: Prevents TemplateNotFound by searching templates/, base dir, and working root.) Tj T*
(  * Embedded NER Gazetteer: 33 pre-indexed Himalayan transit nodes with automatic fallback to Nominatim Geocoder.) Tj T*
(  * Hybrid Routing Pipeline: Primary OSRM driving graph with geometric spline fallback ensuring 100% path generation.) Tj T*
(  * Live NWP Meteorological Telemetry: Direct REST integration with Open-Meteo models polling all 8 state capital hubs.) Tj T*
(  * NER-SMARTBOT Natural Language Engine: Dynamic intent extraction answering routes, convoy speed, and alerts in <80ms.) Tj T*
ET
