0.30 0.35 0.45 rg
(NER-SMARTLOG  |  Hackathon Preparation Guide (SIH PS-26002)) Tj
T*
0 0 0 rg
T*
/F2 11 Tf 14 TL
0.12 0.23 0.54 rg
(4. HACKATHON EVALUATION & VIVA QUESTIONS (PART 1)) Tj T*
T*
/F2 8.5 Tf 11 TL 0.01 0.52 0.78 rg (CATEGORY A: DOMAIN, BASIC CONTEXT & USP) Tj T*
/F2 8 Tf 10.5 TL 0.05 0.10 0.20 rg (Q1. What makes NER-SMARTLOG fundamentally innovative compared to Google Maps?) Tj T*
/F1 7.5 Tf 10 TL 0.15 0.20 0.30 rg
(Ans: Commercial navigation apps optimize strictly for shortest driving time based on current traffic speed. In the Himalayas,) Tj T*
(     roads show 'clear' until a sudden landslide strikes. NER-SMARTLOG is predictive: it evaluates precipitation rates,) Tj T*
(     soil saturation, and verified BRO alerts to steer relief convoys onto safer mountain bypasses before roads get choked.) Tj T*
T*
/F2 8 Tf 10.5 TL 0.05 0.10 0.20 rg (Q2. What are the three command roles and their distinct access permissions?) Tj T*
/F1 7.5 Tf 10 TL 0.15 0.20 0.30 rg
(Ans: 1) Field Patrol Officer [BRO]: Rapid logging of active landslides, floods, and road clearance timelines.) Tj T*
(     2) Convoy Logistics Commander: Fleet GPS tracking [vaccines/oxygen], cargo manifests, and AI route planner.) Tj T*
(     3) State Disaster Controller [SDMA]: Regional threat overview, multi-state coordination, and early warning dispatch.) Tj T*
T*
/F2 8.5 Tf 11 TL 0.01 0.52 0.78 rg (CATEGORY B: ALGORITHMIC & TECHNICAL ARCHITECTURE) Tj T*
/F2 8 Tf 10.5 TL 0.05 0.10 0.20 rg (Q3. How does the AI routing engine compute and select the safest alternative corridor?) Tj T*
/F1 7.5 Tf 10 TL 0.15 0.20 0.30 rg
(Ans: The system queries OSRM for candidate driving corridors, applies the Multi-Factor Risk Equation to each polyline,) Tj T*
(     and dynamically scores them. If the primary highway exceeds Risk > 60 [e.g. NH-13 slide], the engine promotes the) Tj T*
(     safest mountain bypass [e.g. Sela Tunnel Bypass] as the 'AI Optimal Corridor' with green telemetry highlight.) Tj T*
T*
/F2 8 Tf 10.5 TL 0.05 0.10 0.20 rg (Q4. How does Jinja ChoiceLoader eliminate TemplateNotFound errors?) Tj T*
/F1 7.5 Tf 10 TL 0.15 0.20 0.30 rg
(Ans: By binding ChoiceLoader([FileSystemLoader('templates/'), FileSystemLoader(BASE_DIR), FileSystemLoader('.')]),) Tj T*
(     Flask reliably discovers templates whether placed in a subfolder or root, regardless of the working execution path.) Tj T*
T*
/F2 8.5 Tf 11 TL 0.01 0.52 0.78 rg (CATEGORY C: HARDWARE, CONNECTIVITY & OFFLINE ARCHITECTURE) Tj T*
/F2 8 Tf 10.5 TL 0.05 0.10 0.20 rg (Q5. How does the platform function in zero-connectivity mountain blackspots?) Tj T*
/F1 7.5 Tf 10 TL 0.15 0.20 0.30 rg
(Ans: Through an Offline-First design: 1) Pre-cached vector map tiles and routing graphs stored locally before departure.) Tj T*
(     2) Cellular Fallback: When 4G/5G drops, the vehicle unit transmits compressed status packets via SMS/USSD gateways.) Tj T*
T*
/F2 8.5 Tf 11 TL 0.01 0.52 0.78 rg (CATEGORY D: WORKING, VERIFICATION & SECURITY) Tj T*
/F2 8 Tf 10.5 TL 0.05 0.10 0.20 rg (Q6. How does the system prevent fake disaster reports from civilian users?) Tj T*
/F1 7.5 Tf 10 TL 0.15 0.20 0.30 rg
(Ans: Role-Based Cryptographic Access Control [RBAC]. Only verified personnel with authenticated Department Badge IDs) Tj T*
(     [BRO Taskforce, NDRF, SDMA] hold broadcast permissions, ensuring verified, noise-free incident feeds.) Tj T*
ET
