(5. HACKATHON EVALUATION & VIVA QUESTIONS (PART 2)) Tj T*
T*
/F2 8.5 Tf 11 TL 0.01 0.52 0.78 rg (CATEGORY E: LIMITATIONS & EDGE CASES) Tj T*
/F2 8 Tf 10.5 TL 0.05 0.10 0.20 rg (Q7. What are the current limitations of the prototype?) Tj T*
/F1 7.5 Tf 10 TL 0.15 0.20 0.30 rg
(Ans: 1) Public Open-Meteo NWP spatial resolution is 1-2 km; narrow Himalayan gorges can benefit from localized IoT rain gauges.) Tj T*
(     2) Real-time civilian crowd-sourcing is restricted to prevent spam, relying on verified agency patrol logging.) Tj T*
T*
/F2 8.5 Tf 11 TL 0.01 0.52 0.78 rg (CATEGORY F: DIFFICULT JUDGE QUESTIONS & COUNTER-DEFENSES) Tj T*
/F2 8 Tf 10.5 TL 0.05 0.10 0.20 rg (Q8. Judge: 'What if OSRM server goes offline or encounters a routing timeout?') Tj T*
/F1 7.5 Tf 10 TL 0.15 0.20 0.30 rg
(Ans: We built an integrated Geometric Spline Fallback Generator in app.py. If OSRM fails to respond within 3 seconds, the) Tj T*
(     engine generates trigonometric spline corridors between geocoded coordinates, guaranteeing 100% uptime for drivers.) Tj T*
T*
/F2 8.5 Tf 11 TL 0.01 0.52 0.78 rg (CATEGORY G: SUSTAINABILITY, COST & FUTURE SCOPE) Tj T*
/F2 8 Tf 10.5 TL 0.05 0.10 0.20 rg (Q9. How is the project scalable and sustainable for state governments?) Tj T*
/F1 7.5 Tf 10 TL 0.15 0.20 0.30 rg
(Ans: Built 100% on open-source technologies [Python, Leaflet, OpenStreetMap, Open-Meteo], eliminating recurring GIS licenses.) Tj T*
(     Future Roadmap: Phase 2: Direct API tie-in with ISRO Bhuvan/MOSDAC landslide susceptibility satellite maps;) Tj T*
(     Phase 3: Hardwired OBD-II IoT transponders with satellite SOS beacons across state health & FCI fleets.) Tj T*
T*
/F2 11 Tf 14 TL
0.12 0.23 0.54 rg
(6. QUICK-REVISION ELEVATOR PITCHES) Tj T*
/F2 8.5 Tf 11 TL 0.01 0.52 0.78 rg (30-Second Elevator Pitch:) Tj T*
/F1 7.5 Tf 10 TL 0.15 0.20 0.30 rg
(\"NER-SMARTLOG is an AI street logistics and hazard intelligence portal built for MDoNER [SIH 26002]. Unlike reactive GPS apps,) Tj T*
(our platform combines live meteorological sensor feeds, geological risk scoring, and verified ground BRO telemetry to) Tj T*
(predict landslides and re-route essential convoys across 8 North-Eastern states before they get stranded.\") Tj T*
T*
/F2 8.5 Tf 11 TL 0.01 0.52 0.78 rg (1-Minute Comprehensive Pitch:) Tj T*
/F1 7.5 Tf 10 TL 0.15 0.20 0.30 rg
(\"Respected Judges, in North East India, a single monsoon landslide cuts off life-saving oxygen, vaccines, and food supplies) Tj T*
(to remote communities for days. Current navigation tools only show red traffic lines after a corridor is already blocked.) Tj T*
(NER-SMARTLOG solves this by introducing a predictive multi-tier intelligence grid. Our AI router evaluates live rainfall) Tj T*
(volume, slope gradient, and BRO ground reports using a weighted risk index to compute hazard-resilient bypass corridors.) Tj T*
(Featuring dedicated dashboards for BRO Field Patrols, Logistics Commanders, and SDMA Disaster Cells, NER-SMARTLOG transforms) Tj T*
(fragile mountain roads into resilient, life-saving supply lifelines.\") Tj T*
ET
